## Purpose

Implement the October9 21:52 request for unattended README/TODO/book updates and a downloadable
installer/prerelease. This authorizes this delivery work, not repository visibility changes,
universal OS/hardware support, a project license, signing, or promotion to a qualified release.
Workstreams14/17retain the broader release/qualification gates; this is an explicitly unqualified
preview candidate.

## Scope

- Windows11 x64 only; Windows10, ARM, macOS and Linux unsupported.
- v0.2.0-preview.1 prerelease / Windows file version0.2.0.1; unsigned.
- Private repository/release visibility unchanged; download access requires repository permission.
- Inno Setup6.7.3, per-user lowest privileges, stable AppId, native Start-menu launcher.
- Bundled .NET/Python runtime and verified English Vosk/Whisper small.en assets; no end-user
  PowerShell7, system Python, .NET SDK, Docker or automatic model download requirement.
- Setup never launches the app: finish/close, then open from Start. Launch may prepare an idle
  speech service; actual audio capture still requires Start. Setup/launcher status/error UI is
  ordinary-visible, not capture-excluded; install/launch before sharing.
- No provider CLI/model or automatic account/login setup; new profiles retain SnapshotOnly.
  Existing answer/keyboard configuration remains at the same user-profile paths.
- Update rejects downgrades/unrecognized nonempty destinations. Maintenance refuses an open app
  and stops only the authenticated owned idle InstalledRuntime service; no force-close or foreign kill.
- Uninstall removes the installed app/runtime/models/shortcuts. External settings/diagnostics,
  runtime ownership data and saved notes/exports remain for reinstall. Manual reset is separate.
- Program directories are managed/replaced; personal content must live outside them.
- Source/legacy ZIP workflows remain distinct. No startup/taskbar-stealth/system policy changes.

