## Qualification and privacy boundaries

SmartScreen and organizational policy may block unsigned code; no disabling/bypass instructions.
No real notes/audio, user-instance termination or provider authentication was used for these final
component checks. Local model inference used generated PCM only; documentation did not execute it.
Captured-recipient compatibility stays NOT_TESTED
until its separate evidence exists. Docker remains optional final-stage workstream20.
Bundled dependency licenses do not select a license for Phantom Fudge.

